// Title: Potential Suspicious Change To Sensitive/Critical Files
// Rule ID: 86157017-c2b1-4d4a-8c33-93b8e67e4af4
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.impact, attack.t1565.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: linux
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/linux/process_creation/proc_creation_lnx_susp_sensitive_file_access.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
